{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.poster.avif?t=1771377210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.webm?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.mp4?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim your bounty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a tense, lightning fast combat; Use mobility, skill and whim to overcome fearsome Underwest barons and their servants. Master weapon abilities to get out of any tricky situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.poster.avif?t=1771377210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/85e781db321dae726e14d1b16028a62a.webm?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Graphic Novel aesthetic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse meticulously designed world of the Underwest, depicted in breathtaking, hand drawn animation. Jump through numerous panels, inspired by the works of Genndy Tartakovsky (Samurai Jack, Primal)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.poster.avif?t=1771377210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.webm?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/4b4d677a549dcb4c2fcb9c7a2dd665af.mp4?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Wild West Underworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture a variety of spirit realms, full of mystery and despair. Uncover Underwest\u2019s many secrets and search for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.poster.avif?t=1771377210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.webm?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/5bd275d3faf91ac8d95cbe7a417ec8bb.mp4?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grand story of loss and devotion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Soul of Rosebud, daughter of former outlaw gunslinger, Rose, has been imprisoned in a locket by Envy, one of the Seven Deadly Sins. To free her daughter, Rose must do his bidding. True to his name, Envy craves the power possessed by the other Deadly Sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Rose as she journeys into the Underwest - the wild west's mysterious underworld. Hunt down Pride, Greed, Lust, Gluttony, Wrath, and Sloth, and collect their bounties for your new master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a dark, yet vibrant world below. Test your acrobatic gunslinging skills in dynamic boss battles featuring high-energy 360\u00b0 shooting galleries. Uncover the mysteries of Rose\u2019s past as she once again relies on her trusty six-shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned: nothing is quite as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivered in a bold, handcrafted, cinematic style with full voice acting and narration, Rose and Locket blurs the line between graphic novel and game experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1697850?t=1771377210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1697850?t=1771377210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/2176de6b6f884cf2412a0becd8bfb41a3a5695c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771377210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/2176de6b6f884cf2412a0becd8bfb41a3a5695c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771377210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2867750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.poster.avif?t=1771377210\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1697850/extras/b670a17cb394f26bdca816c219f1fb96.webm?t=1771377210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://s